      "content": "hey i have this really bad cough like its super productive and making me feel miserable. i'm currently taking sertraline for my anxiety/depression and i saw some stuff at the drugstore with dextromethorphan in it (dm). is it okay to take that with my sertraline so i can finally get some sleep? i just really need something that works fast.",
